WEBVTT

00:00:05.730 --> 00:00:08.360
Thank you for waiting!

00:00:16.830 --> 00:00:18.750
Wowww!

00:00:21.290 --> 00:00:23.800
Check please!

00:00:24.920 --> 00:00:26.380
I can get money!

00:00:27.250 --> 00:00:29.100
Thank you for waiting!

00:00:31.800 --> 00:00:34.720
I’m typing with my legs!

00:00:37.600 --> 00:00:40.770
Business is prospering
thanks to Bu-Ling-san.

00:00:40.770 --> 00:00:44.020
But she makes this place seem like a different store.

00:00:44.020 --> 00:00:46.190
When the store’s busy
it’s tiring for us.

00:00:46.690 --> 00:00:47.940
Yeah…

00:00:47.940 --> 00:00:51.650
Sometimes I feel like going on vacation to relieve the stress.

00:00:52.610 --> 00:00:53.860
Mail’s here!

00:00:54.200 --> 00:00:55.830
Thank you!

00:00:59.700 --> 00:01:01.200
T-This is...!

00:01:01.660 --> 00:01:02.200
Why?

00:01:02.200 --> 00:01:02.960
What is it?

00:01:02.960 --> 00:01:03.620
What’s that?

00:01:03.620 --> 00:01:10.680
We won a day-trip to the Hakogawara Princess Resort Suite Cottage as a prize!

00:01:20.560 --> 00:01:22.560
Hakogawara Princess Resort!?

00:01:22.560 --> 00:01:24.820
It’s an expensive cottage!

00:01:25.730 --> 00:01:27.730
I can stay there for a day?

00:01:27.730 --> 00:01:31.480
There’s a terrace where you can view the lake from above, and a private hot spring.

00:01:31.480 --> 00:01:33.940
The dining room is Art Deco style…

00:01:33.940 --> 00:01:36.160
and they have gorgeous interiors!

00:01:36.160 --> 00:01:38.450
I like to go too.

00:01:38.450 --> 00:01:42.410
And there’s a lot of nature around the place!

00:01:43.120 --> 00:01:47.790
So… we came to Hakogawara!

00:01:47.790 --> 00:01:49.540
Let’s see… that way!

00:01:49.540 --> 00:01:50.880
Let’s see… that way!

00:02:01.100 --> 00:02:04.000
We’re going pretty deep into the mountains…

00:02:04.000 --> 00:02:05.350
Are you sure it’s the right way?

00:02:06.230 --> 00:02:07.520
Yes.

00:02:07.520 --> 00:02:08.810
It’s right.

00:02:12.570 --> 00:02:16.900
I made this last night.
Please eat heartily!

00:02:16.900 --> 00:02:20.200
Yeah! Time to eat!

00:02:20.200 --> 00:02:21.620
Itadakimasu!

00:02:24.410 --> 00:02:26.540
Wow! This is good!

00:02:26.540 --> 00:02:29.830
Lunch you eat under the blue sky tastes much better! ~nya!

00:02:29.830 --> 00:02:32.760
I was hungry from all the walking.

00:02:33.340 --> 00:02:34.800
Is the cottage nearby?

00:02:35.460 --> 00:02:39.300
Well… It seems we’re only
halfway there.

00:02:39.590 --> 00:02:41.680
EHHhhh!!!??

00:02:42.760 --> 00:02:44.390
S-Sorry!

00:02:45.250 --> 00:02:46.430
Don’t worry about it.

00:02:46.430 --> 00:02:50.440
We’re okay. The food will taste better if we walk alot.

00:02:50.440 --> 00:02:51.610
Yes!

00:02:51.610 --> 00:02:55.240
Retasu-oneechan’s food tastes good!

00:02:57.760 --> 00:03:00.400
Yeah…

00:03:00.950 --> 00:03:04.920
It would be nice if I could have lunch like this with Aoyama-kun…

00:03:06.580 --> 00:03:07.840
HEY YOU!

00:03:08.710 --> 00:03:09.330
What?

00:03:09.330 --> 00:03:11.290
What are you doing there?!

00:03:19.720 --> 00:03:21.230
Aoyama-kun!?

00:03:23.140 --> 00:03:24.770
What brings you here?

00:03:25.470 --> 00:03:27.880
You surprised us!
We didn’t expect you around.

00:03:27.880 --> 00:03:30.900
Perhaps it’s fate that
brought us together?

00:03:33.150 --> 00:03:35.530
You should’ve walked with us!

00:03:36.110 --> 00:03:37.700
Hey, let’s eat lunch together.

00:03:38.430 --> 00:03:40.900
Eat lunch HERE?
What are you talking about?

00:03:42.200 --> 00:03:44.330
Aoyama-kun, what’s the matter?

00:03:44.330 --> 00:03:46.370
Did I say something weird?

00:03:46.950 --> 00:03:48.330
Aoyama?

00:03:48.330 --> 00:03:50.830
Why do you know my name?

00:03:50.830 --> 00:03:53.830
It’s Masazo Aoyamada.

00:03:53.830 --> 00:03:55.750
EHhhh!?

00:03:55.750 --> 00:03:57.090
Aoyamada?

00:03:57.090 --> 00:03:58.000
Masazo?

00:03:58.670 --> 00:04:01.970
So it’s not Aoyama-kun after all…

00:04:02.720 --> 00:04:05.890
That’s the shrine of Bachigappa. Don’t soil it!

00:04:07.630 --> 00:04:08.850
Bachigappa?

00:04:09.390 --> 00:04:10.640
Yes,

00:04:10.640 --> 00:04:12.570
…it’s the guardian of this mountain!

00:04:13.150 --> 00:04:14.440
If you don’t be careful,

00:04:14.440 --> 00:04:16.270
…the gods might punish you!

00:04:16.980 --> 00:04:21.450
He’s a frightening god who punishes those who soil this place.

00:04:23.450 --> 00:04:27.080
Geez, city dwellers come here without knowing anything.

00:04:27.530 --> 00:04:28.740
What foolish people.

00:04:32.000 --> 00:04:33.620
What a scary person.

00:04:33.620 --> 00:04:34.370
Let’s go.

00:04:35.040 --> 00:04:37.040
Aoyamada-kun, huh?

00:04:44.550 --> 00:04:47.650
Everyone, we’re almost here!

00:04:48.510 --> 00:04:52.140
I think we’re going somewhere more dangerous than before.

00:04:52.140 --> 00:04:55.100
This place is too wild for me.

00:04:55.650 --> 00:04:57.060
There it is!

00:04:57.480 --> 00:04:59.860
There’s the hot spring!

00:04:59.860 --> 00:05:01.410
REALLY?!

00:05:02.340 --> 00:05:04.320
Yeah!!

00:05:10.700 --> 00:05:11.870
What is this?

00:05:13.160 --> 00:05:15.830
This is a natural hot spring!

00:05:15.830 --> 00:05:19.170
I… I’m sorry! I made a mistake!

00:05:19.170 --> 00:05:21.050
What should I do?

00:05:21.050 --> 00:05:22.880
Yahoo!

00:05:26.440 --> 00:05:28.720
This feels good. So comforting…

00:05:30.920 --> 00:05:32.680
I feel like I can become beautiful.

00:05:32.680 --> 00:05:35.640
Everyone is a friend at a hot spring!

00:05:39.320 --> 00:05:41.610
Ehh, I’m going in too!

00:05:42.440 --> 00:05:44.570
I’ll join you.

00:05:45.040 --> 00:05:47.780
I’ll join as well!

00:05:50.950 --> 00:05:53.680
Wow, this really feels good…

00:05:53.680 --> 00:05:54.750
I’m glad…

00:05:54.750 --> 00:05:57.330
These monkeys are sure kind.

00:05:57.330 --> 00:06:00.250
Something wild like this
is good once in a while.

00:06:00.250 --> 00:06:03.160
But I was surprised back there.

00:06:03.160 --> 00:06:06.470
I can’t believe someone who looks just like Aoyama-kun exists.

00:06:07.180 --> 00:06:09.720
Yeah, I thought Aoyama-kun was here.

00:06:10.220 --> 00:06:13.770
But he was such a rude person to shout at us like that.

00:06:13.770 --> 00:06:15.860
We were just eating lunch.

00:06:16.890 --> 00:06:18.190
That feels good.

00:06:24.820 --> 00:06:28.040
But, a wild Aoyama-kun…

00:06:28.740 --> 00:06:31.040
That might be good, too.

00:06:34.750 --> 00:06:36.080
What is it?

00:06:36.080 --> 00:06:38.170
Is it Bachigappa?

00:06:38.170 --> 00:06:39.870
What? No way.

00:06:45.300 --> 00:06:47.210
It’s Bachigappa!

00:06:47.720 --> 00:06:48.970
What?!

00:06:52.680 --> 00:06:54.180
BACHIGAPPA!

00:06:58.230 --> 00:07:00.100
Please forgive us!

00:07:00.100 --> 00:07:04.110
I’ll give you our lunch!..

00:07:01.020 --> 00:07:04.110
Sorry sorry sorry…

00:07:11.950 --> 00:07:13.390
What the?..

00:07:13.390 --> 00:07:16.250
This place is forbidden since it’s under construction.

00:07:29.380 --> 00:07:31.260
I’m getting cold.

00:07:31.800 --> 00:07:33.730
Sorry for scaring you all.

00:07:34.390 --> 00:07:37.210
But, there’s a plan to build
a resort here.

00:07:37.210 --> 00:07:38.480
…To build a resort here?

00:07:38.480 --> 00:07:40.440
Yes.

00:07:40.440 --> 00:07:43.450
This hot spring will become
a gorgeous cottage.

00:07:44.150 --> 00:07:45.900
A gorgeous cottage?

00:07:47.280 --> 00:07:48.080
Huh?

00:07:48.440 --> 00:07:52.400
The date we get to use the cottage
is next year…

00:07:52.740 --> 00:07:54.490
WHAT?!

00:07:54.490 --> 00:07:57.160
I’m sorry. I’m sorry. I’m sorry.

00:07:57.620 --> 00:07:59.210
Don’t worry about it.

00:07:59.790 --> 00:08:02.460
The hot spring here really was nice.

00:08:02.460 --> 00:08:03.620
You all!

00:08:03.620 --> 00:08:06.550
Stop the construction!

00:08:09.510 --> 00:08:10.630
That person is…

00:08:10.630 --> 00:08:12.180
Aoyamada-kun.

00:08:12.180 --> 00:08:14.300
Is he complaining to someone again?

00:08:14.300 --> 00:08:17.260
Get out of the way, boy.
You’re blocking us.

00:08:17.260 --> 00:08:20.180
If you destroy the mountain, you’ll get punished by Bachigappa!

00:08:21.390 --> 00:08:23.690
We don’t need a resort
in this mountain!

00:08:33.010 --> 00:08:34.180
Hey!

00:08:34.180 --> 00:08:36.570
Don’t bother us. It’s dangerous.

00:08:37.270 --> 00:08:39.580
We don’t need a resort
in this mountain!

00:08:42.290 --> 00:08:46.660
This mountain belongs to the animals, insects, trees, and flowers.

00:08:47.400 --> 00:08:50.210
It can’t be destroyed for leisure of the city people!

00:08:50.210 --> 00:08:55.180
Damn kid… You always interfere! Don’t mess with adults!

00:08:58.790 --> 00:08:59.510
Watch out!

00:09:01.520 --> 00:09:02.520
Aoyamada-kun!

00:09:03.840 --> 00:09:04.850
Are you okay?

00:09:06.960 --> 00:09:08.470
You’re not hurt, correct?

00:09:08.470 --> 00:09:10.300
Cut out this foolish act immediately.

00:09:10.300 --> 00:09:13.890
The project was decided by your dad and the whole village.

00:09:16.560 --> 00:09:18.650
Aoyamada-kun, are you okay?

00:09:26.940 --> 00:09:28.910
Why did you do such a reckless thing?

00:09:29.610 --> 00:09:32.300
You could’ve gotten hurt.

00:09:34.490 --> 00:09:35.720
When I was young…

00:09:37.930 --> 00:09:41.890
Otters lived in this river.

00:09:42.210 --> 00:09:43.890
Otters?

00:09:43.890 --> 00:09:45.550
Yes, otters.

00:09:46.460 --> 00:09:48.680
I liked them…

00:09:50.340 --> 00:09:55.060
I was especially friendly with Kawataro.

00:09:56.610 --> 00:10:01.070
But lately, I don’t see them.

00:10:01.070 --> 00:10:06.040
I believe that they are
alive somewhere though.

00:10:06.820 --> 00:10:09.370
But the construction has begun…

00:10:10.690 --> 00:10:14.240
…The otters will lose their home for real at this rate.

00:10:14.240 --> 00:10:17.210
That’s why I wanted to stop them.

00:10:18.040 --> 00:10:19.670
But, it’s a stupid thing.

00:10:20.260 --> 00:10:22.870
The adults decided all this,

00:10:22.870 --> 00:10:25.720
so a child like me is powerless.

00:10:27.090 --> 00:10:29.770
I can only pray to Bachigappa.

00:10:35.260 --> 00:10:39.360
“Please let at least one of Kawataro and his friends survive.”

00:10:45.520 --> 00:10:48.660
Well, I guess it’s a boring story to you city dwellers.

00:10:49.480 --> 00:10:51.880
Nope. That’s not true.

00:10:52.490 --> 00:10:57.160
Because, I have a friend
who loves animals.

00:10:59.080 --> 00:11:01.340
So someone like that exist among the city people?

00:11:01.340 --> 00:11:03.250
Yes!

00:11:03.250 --> 00:11:05.680
Really?
What kind of a guy is he?

00:11:05.680 --> 00:11:07.470
Well,

00:11:07.470 --> 00:11:09.140
he’s bright,

00:11:09.550 --> 00:11:11.020
he’s kind,

00:11:11.020 --> 00:11:12.770
cool,

00:11:12.770 --> 00:11:15.940
strong, reliable and…

00:11:16.440 --> 00:11:18.400
And he’s my…

00:11:21.220 --> 00:11:22.820
Important person!

00:11:25.770 --> 00:11:29.150
WUAahhh! What am I saying?

00:11:29.150 --> 00:11:32.580
Oh, so you like him!

00:11:35.530 --> 00:11:37.660
I didn’t say that much.

00:11:39.490 --> 00:11:42.540
Then ask Bachigappa.

00:11:43.410 --> 00:11:47.760
Bachigappa is a kind god of marriage as well.

00:11:48.170 --> 00:11:50.260
I’ll ask him with you.

00:11:51.040 --> 00:11:53.220
It looks like he’s willing to hear.

00:11:54.130 --> 00:11:56.940
Why don’t the rest of you ask too if you all have somebody you like.

00:11:57.320 --> 00:11:59.180
Okay, I will!

00:11:59.180 --> 00:12:01.310
Then I’ll do it, too.

00:12:01.310 --> 00:12:03.770
A person I like? Oh my…

00:12:03.770 --> 00:12:07.320
Hey, Bu-Ling loves everyone!

00:12:11.730 --> 00:12:12.830
My, my.

00:12:13.730 --> 00:12:16.040
They’re on a picnic here?

00:12:16.040 --> 00:12:20.710
The person with the
perfect Spirit is here.

00:12:23.200 --> 00:12:25.250
Be careful when you go home!

00:12:25.250 --> 00:12:26.540
Thank you!

00:12:26.040 --> 00:12:27.880
Good bye!

00:12:26.540 --> 00:12:27.880
I had fun!

00:12:36.310 --> 00:12:37.810
Who are you?!

00:12:45.440 --> 00:12:50.610
Now, pure Spirit, call back the life within the soiled earth.

00:12:52.400 --> 00:12:54.030
FUSION!

00:13:10.640 --> 00:13:12.250
Emergency!

00:13:12.250 --> 00:13:15.640
Bachigappa… Bachigappa is here!

00:13:16.510 --> 00:13:17.970
What did you say?

00:13:17.970 --> 00:13:20.470
This looks like trouble.

00:13:20.470 --> 00:13:25.950
Bachigappa must’ve got mad because of the construction and started to get violent!

00:13:25.950 --> 00:13:28.230
It’s a curse!

00:13:28.230 --> 00:13:30.570
It’s Bachigappa’s curse!

00:13:31.940 --> 00:13:36.170
Is this the punishment for eating lunch at the shrine?

00:13:38.490 --> 00:13:39.840
I’m scared…

00:13:42.610 --> 00:13:45.670
Such an unscientific thing
don’t happen.

00:13:46.490 --> 00:13:47.300
Could it be…

00:13:47.870 --> 00:13:49.760
…a Chimera Anima?

00:14:06.430 --> 00:14:09.410
Hehehe… so you all finally arrived.

00:14:12.020 --> 00:14:14.070
So it was you behind it again!

00:14:14.650 --> 00:14:16.500
What do you want
coming all the way here?

00:14:16.500 --> 00:14:18.690
I’m a capricious guy.

00:14:18.690 --> 00:14:21.740
Now, if you don’t defeat the Chimera Anima,

00:14:21.740 --> 00:14:23.500
…his life will be in danger.

00:14:26.870 --> 00:14:28.000
{Hhhaaaaa~! }Aoyamada-kun!

00:14:31.890 --> 00:14:32.960
Let’s go!

00:14:33.920 --> 00:14:38.390
Mew Mew Strawberry METAMORPHO-SE!

00:14:50.850 --> 00:14:54.690
Mew Mew Mint METAMORPHO-SE!

00:14:59.610 --> 00:15:03.460
Mew Mew Lettuce METAMORPHO-SE!

00:15:07.570 --> 00:15:11.340
Mew Mew Pudding METAMORPHO-SE!

00:15:21.800 --> 00:15:23.730
For the future of the Earth…

00:15:23.730 --> 00:15:25.650
At your service! ~Nya!

00:15:28.450 --> 00:15:32.730
For using the Spirit of a pure boy who loves nature!

00:15:32.730 --> 00:15:33.780
I won’t forgive you!

00:15:34.390 --> 00:15:36.150
I’ll go first!

00:15:37.190 --> 00:15:40.460
Reborn… Mint ECHO!!

00:15:43.530 --> 00:15:45.670
LettasTanets!

00:15:48.880 --> 00:15:52.550
Reborn… Lettuce RUSH!

00:15:57.580 --> 00:16:02.440
Reborn… PuddingRings INFERNO!!

00:16:06.130 --> 00:16:08.430
It’s fast and using the geographical features to it’s advantage.

00:16:08.430 --> 00:16:11.270
It’s just running away.

00:16:15.850 --> 00:16:18.370
But there’s no more place to hide.

00:16:20.980 --> 00:16:22.540
It’s coming!

00:16:28.740 --> 00:16:29.920
Damn you...!

00:16:29.920 --> 00:16:31.500
StrawberBell!

00:16:43.100 --> 00:16:44.350
It smells!

00:16:45.260 --> 00:16:47.850
What’s this strong smell?

00:16:54.060 --> 00:16:55.470
What kind of animal is this?

00:16:55.470 --> 00:16:57.640
I’m starting to lose the will to fight…

00:16:57.640 --> 00:16:58.730
Yeah!

00:16:59.230 --> 00:17:00.740
I can’t breath!

00:17:09.650 --> 00:17:11.170
No… we’re going to lose…

00:17:13.840 --> 00:17:15.800
Take this!

00:17:19.040 --> 00:17:21.260
Bu-Ling! Why?

00:17:21.710 --> 00:17:22.770
Huh? {(*sneeze)}

00:17:24.920 --> 00:17:26.760
What are you guys doing?

00:17:26.760 --> 00:17:29.310
Why are you all sleeping there?

00:17:30.130 --> 00:17:31.800
Her nose is running…

00:17:31.800 --> 00:17:35.240
So Bu-Ling-san has a cold and can’t smell anything!

00:17:40.960 --> 00:17:42.320
PuddingRings!

00:17:54.160 --> 00:17:56.330
Reborn…

00:17:56.870 --> 00:18:00.180
PuddingRings INFERNO!!

00:18:03.380 --> 00:18:04.550
She did it!

00:18:05.170 --> 00:18:06.520
Now, Mew Strawberry!

00:18:07.300 --> 00:18:08.850
StrawberBell!

00:18:21.940 --> 00:18:25.750
Reborn Strawberry… CHECK!!

00:18:36.620 --> 00:18:38.080
Retrieval complete!

00:18:46.750 --> 00:18:48.760
Aoyamada-kun, Aoyamada-kun?

00:19:02.350 --> 00:19:03.120
Huh?

00:19:03.850 --> 00:19:05.240
Where am I?..

00:19:10.050 --> 00:19:11.050
Could you be…

00:19:13.990 --> 00:19:15.450
Kawataro?

00:19:18.620 --> 00:19:20.010
It’s you, isn’t it?

00:19:23.080 --> 00:19:26.380
Kawataro, where were you?

00:19:27.420 --> 00:19:28.800
I was so worried!

00:19:31.510 --> 00:19:33.600
It’s a heart moving reunion.

00:19:36.510 --> 00:19:38.190
What a boring ending.

00:19:43.600 --> 00:19:46.360
I wanted you all to meet Kawataro.

00:19:47.440 --> 00:19:48.830
Come visit again.

00:19:48.830 --> 00:19:50.730
Yes, we will.

00:19:50.730 --> 00:19:52.610
It’s a promise.

00:19:52.610 --> 00:19:54.290
You must be glad, Aoyamada-kun.

00:19:54.290 --> 00:19:55.700
Yeah.

00:19:55.700 --> 00:19:59.540
As long as the otters live there…
I will make them stop the construction!

00:20:01.080 --> 00:20:05.390
The villagers will also oppose the construction because of what happened.

00:20:05.390 --> 00:20:09.530
Now Bu-Ling’s friends will be able to live in peace too.

00:20:25.240 --> 00:20:30.500
Minto and her brother don’t seem to get along.

00:20:30.500 --> 00:20:35.420
But Minto-san likes her brother in her heart.

00:20:35.420 --> 00:20:36.460
Alright!

00:20:36.460 --> 00:20:40.470
If that’s the fact, then we need to help her out!

00:20:40.470 --> 00:20:41.510
We will help!

00:20:41.510 --> 00:20:44.840
Bu-Ling-san, that’s not how you help!..

00:20:44.840 --> 00:20:48.850
Next time: Dearly Beloved Brother.
The Memories lie in the Picture!

00:20:48.850 --> 00:20:51.850
For the Earth’s future,
we’ll be of service ~nya!
